      },
      "lineNbr": 29,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002790
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-27T08:03:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve dropped `DeviceName` as well, so `Name` is the only name a record carries.",
      "parentUuid": "2bcaddc6_5202b40b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 29,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 29,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "4e13cf52e4d897c12703c573767f2caf4eb0bf7a",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "412a9062_36acf953",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 17
      },
      "lineNbr": 29,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-27T17:01:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com, to make things more clear, `Name` is used by Entity-Manager to derive the Entity-Manager D-Bus Object Path this config will be put on. `DeviceName` was meant to be consumed by nvidia-gpu to name the device on nvidia-gpu\u0027s D-Bus. I suggested to keep both of these property separate to gain that extra bit of flexibility in defining the configs. But if `DeviceName` seems redundant to you, I am also ok with removing it.",
      "parentUuid": "f05a49fa_9e72e4d0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 29,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 29,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "4e13cf52e4d897c12703c573767f2caf4eb0bf7a",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
